{% lede %}
Sum Some Sines is a Processing script I wrote to visualize the addition of sine waves. You can graphically adjust the amplitude, frequency and phase of individual waves and watch the pattern they add up to.
{% /lede %}

It came out of the Harmonic Analyzer project: the machine does this mechanically, with rocker arms and springs, and I wanted a version you could play with on a screen.
